Overflow keyboard isolation is authored GPL-3.0-only panel code. Original panel
b5cc19e351b82eed999097ced1ff267d27bf8e7a source is authenticated through the
existing pinned-keyboard-focus GPL fixture and full license. This transform
changes only the actual overflow view's wrapper and adds an authored child
module; the original SDK button and MPL/GPL/MIT notices/licenses remain intact.

The module delegates the original-feature widget tree, layout, focus operations,
non-keyboard input, draw, pointer interaction, overlay, id and drag destinations.
Every keyboard event is refused before SDK processing; no keyboard activation,
traversal, popup serial/grab authority or accessibility acceptance is supplied.
The supported reviewed SDK feature set is []; a11y-enabled builds are not
verified by this seam and must not be claimed as accessible recovery.
